.el .ds Aq '
.TH history 1  "history " 
.SH NAME
history \- Show accepted Change history
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBhistory\fR [\fB\-\-oneline\fR] [\fB\-\-limit\fR] [\fB\-\-element\fR] [\fB\-\-compact\fR] [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Show accepted Change history
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH INSPECTION
.TP
\fB\-\-oneline\fR
Format each history entry as a single line
.TP
\fB\-\-limit\fR \fI<LIMIT>\fR
Limit output to the N most recent revisions
.TP
\fB\-\-element\fR \fI<ELEMENT>\fR
Filter history to revisions touching a specific element ID or prefix
.TP
\fB\-\-compact\fR
Display compact output
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Output structured machine JSON envelope
